    {
      "source_pin": {
        "path": "/home/sihyeon/workspace/spectra/logs/tsg/RAN/formal/RAN3/phase-3/cq_test_dataset.json",
        "sha256": "70ee891e7b9a2def331d4bf7d322707bbb0e3fc32edb128cbfb6e054030d00f5"
      },
      "literal_lines": [
        {
          "line_1based": 254,
          "text": "      \"id\": \"CQ3-7\","
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 255,
          "text": "      \"category\": \"CQ3_CR연결\","
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 256,
          "text": "      \"question\": \"clausesAffected로 실제 Section과 매칭되는 CR 목록은?\","
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 257,
          "text": "      \"cypher\": \"MATCH (cr:CR)-[:MODIFIES]->(hub:Spec {specNumber:'38.423'}) WHERE hub.specRelease IS NULL AND cr.clausesAffected IS NOT NULL AND cr.clausesAffected <> '' WITH cr, hub, split(cr.clausesAffected, ',') AS clauses MATCH (rk:Spec)-[:IN_RELEASE_OF]->(hub) WITH cr, clauses, rk ORDER BY toInteger(replace(rk.specRelease,'Rel-','')) DESC WITH cr, clauses, collect(rk)[0] AS latestRk UNWIND clauses AS clause WITH cr, latestRk, trim(clause) AS clause MATCH (s:Section)-[:BELONGS_TO_SPEC]->(latestRk) WHERE s.sectionNumber = clause RETURN cr.tdocNumber, clause, s.sectionId LIMIT 10\","
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 258,
          "text": "      \"expected_min_rows\": 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_pin": {
        "path": "/home/sihyeon/workspace/spectra/docs/tsg/RAN/formal/RAN3/phase-3/design-spec/tdoc_ontology_specs(TS).md",
        "sha256": "d99ed8c793e5e378dd430b9e97bca80a78ea477c007523396c1c983481580391"
      },
      "literal_lines": [
        {
          "line_1based": 74,
          "text": "    "
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 75,
          "text": "    | 구분 | 포함 대상 |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 76,
          "text": "    | --- | --- |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 77,
          "text": "    | **TS 문서** | 38.401, 38.410~38.415, 38.420~38.425, 38.455, 38.460~38.463, 38.470~38.475 (**24개**) — release별 데이터는 38.475 제외 **23개** (38.475는 per-release 데이터 부재) |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 78,
          "text": "    | **Release 차원 (release-aware)** | 각 TS의 **release별 final 버전** (Rel-15/16/17/18/19). 동일 spec번호라도 release마다 **별개 Spec 노드**이며, sectionId·Spec IRI가 release 키를 포함한다 (예: `38.413-Rel-15-...` ≠ `38.413-Rel-17-...`). spec×release = spec-release 단위로 적재 (spec-release 수는 Appendix A.1.3 참조) |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 79,
          "text": "    | **Section 구조** | 본문 + Annex, 5레벨까지 (Heading 8 = Annex) |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 80,
          "text": "    | **Table 메타데이터** | ID, 캡션, 번호, 위치 |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 81,
          "text": "    | **Figure 메타데이터** | ID, 캡션, 번호, 위치 |"
        },
        {
          "line_1based": 82,
          "text": "    | **TS 간 참조** | Section 간 내부/외부 참조 |"
        },
